# DeepSeek Harness bootstrap secrets — sourced into the environment by the
# start-dsh.* launchers before dsh starts (dsh refuses to read launch-control
# variable names like DSH_API_KEY from its own .env files — verified against
# dsh 0.1.1-rc.2), so this file deliberately uses a name dsh does not auto-read.
DSH_API_KEY={{DSH_API_KEY}}